# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Names only — never commit values.
# Export before `python -m dskit.onboarding acquire`:
#     set -a; . ./.env; set +a
#
# Predexon (historical L2 ladder snapshots) — the only source that needs a
# key. The source config names this variable (`api_key_env`); the connector
# reads the environment at check()/read() time and never persists the value.
PREDEXON_API_KEY=
#
# Kalshi and Polymarket are read through their PUBLIC endpoints (settled
# markets, candles, order books) — no credentials. Trading keys are never
# part of this child: it reads, tests, sizes; it does not place orders.
#
# Optional: a Hugging Face hub token for the pmxt L2 archive mirror the
# Polymarket `archive_hours` stream reads (anonymous access works; a token
# lifts the hub's rate limit). The source config names this variable
# (`token_env`); leave it empty for anonymous pulls.
HF_TOKEN=
